#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/api.html:18
msgid ""
"The <strong>Leibniz Data Manager (LDM)</strong> is an open-source and free web-based application for Research Data Management (RDM). To facilitate "
"integration with external tools and workflows, the LDM offers a series of APIs that fulfil various data management purposes."
