#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/special_conditions_LDM.html:21
msgid "The Leibniz Data Manager (LDM) service is provided by:"
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/special_conditions_LDM.html:37
msgid "Scope of Application"
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/special_conditions_LDM.html:38
msgid ""
"These Special Conditions of the LDM regulate the use of the LDM as well as the rights and obligations of Registered Users and the TIB in addition to the "
"Terms of Use of TIB."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/special_conditions_LDM.html:42
#, python-format
msgid ""
"LDM is primarily aimed at scholars who want to share, explore and reuse research datasets in a novel manner. The LDM is built on top of %(ckan_link)s and the"
" LDM software is freely accessible to everyone."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/special_conditions_LDM.html:44
msgid "Registration"
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/special_conditions_LDM.html:45
msgid "LDM datasets can be searched and explored without registration."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/special_conditions_LDM.html:46
msgid "The upload and description of dataset metadata require registration (Registered Users)."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/special_conditions_LDM.html:47
msgid "An LDM dataset can be accessed following the access rights imposed by the Registered Users who are the dataset creators."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/special_conditions_LDM.html:48
msgid ""
"There is no entitlement to registration, account, or profile. The TIB is entitled to reject registrations or terminate accounts if a violation of these "
"Special Conditions LDM exists or is expected."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/special_conditions_LDM.html:49
msgid ""
"When registering, users must agree to the Special Conditions of the LDM and the Data Protection Declaration. If these Special Conditions of the LDM are "
"updated, Registered Users will be notified of the changes two weeks in advance by email. By subsequently continuing to use LDM, Registered Users agree to the"
" changes."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/special_conditions_LDM.html:50
msgid "A usage relationship is established between the TIB and the Registered User through registration."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/special_conditions_LDM.html:51
msgid ""
"When registering, users are obliged to fill in mandatory fields truthfully and completely, to keep their data up-to-date and secret and to protect data from "
"access by third parties."
msgstr ""

