#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/special_conditions_LDM.html:61
msgid ""
"TIB will terminate accounts at the request of the user in text form at any time and without undue delay. All personal data in the user profile will be "
"deleted without undue delay. Content created by users remains published as long as the TIB does not delete this content or the user does not request its "
"deletion, whereupon the TIB will anonymize this content."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/special_conditions_LDM.html:64
msgid ""
"Anyone can view and use LDM content (the metadata of the LDM datasets). Registered Users can add datasets, and create and modify the metadata of their "
"datasets."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/special_conditions_LDM.html:65
msgid "The source code is made available under the GNU Affero General Public v3.0 License."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/special_conditions_LDM.html:66
msgid ""
"Registered Users confirm that the datasets they publish and the metadata they provide, do not infringe any third-party rights (e.g. copyright, rights of "
"performers, personality and publicity rights, data protection). If others are involved in the production, Registered Users confirm that all participants are "
"aware of the content of this agreement and have given their consent."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/special_conditions_LDM.html:67
msgid ""
"Registered Users ensure that the datasets they publish and the metadata they provide, do not violate applicable law or offend common decency, in particular, "
"they do not constitute a criminal offense and do not constitute an administrative offense (e.g. infringement of copyright, trademark law, competition law) or"
" none have offensive, discriminatory, racist, pornographic or extremist content. In the event of a violation, Section 5 applies."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/special_conditions_LDM.html:68
msgid "If a user becomes aware of a violation of the law within the meaning of 3.3 or 3.4 he / she is obliged to inform the TIB immediately."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/special_conditions_LDM.html:69
msgid ""
"Registered Users will indemnify the TIB from all claims of other users or third parties that they assert against the TIB due to infringement of their rights "
"through content published by the respective Registered User, if the respective user can be held responsible. The respective Registered User assumes the costs"
" of an appropriate legal defense of the TIB. This does not apply if the Registered User is not responsible for the infringement. Users are obliged to provide"
" all information necessary for the examination of the claims and a defense in the event of a claim against the TIB truthfully and completely without further "
"delay."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/special_conditions_LDM.html:71
msgid "Functionality of the LDM"
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/special_conditions_LDM.html:72
msgid ""
"Anyone can use the LDM service to explore LDM datasets without registration. The metadata describing the LDM datasets can be reused freely for any purpose "
"users see fit, in accordance with the CC BY-SA License (5.2 of these Special Conditions LDM). The LDM datasets can be reused following the regulations "
"imposed by the license of the dataset, which is specified by the registered user who created the dataset in LDM."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/special_conditions_LDM.html:73
msgid ""
"LDM provides functionality that requires registration. Adding and editing, including deleting, existing datasets and their metadata is reserved for "
"Registered Users. Metadata about the LDM datasets is created and edited in accordance with the CC0 License (5.1 of these Special Conditions LDM). Registered "
"Users obtain LDM user profiles, can link their profile to ORCiD; the profiles include provenance information."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/special_conditions_LDM.html:74
msgid ""
"LDM provides programmatic access to the content (API). Anyone can use the LDM API to access existing content. Creating and editing, including deleting, "
"existing content via the LDM API is reserved for Registered Users."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/special_conditions_LDM.html:75
msgid ""
"LDM enables DOI-based publication of LDM datasets. In doing so, metadata including creator names and, if known, ORCiD IDs are shared with DataCite. If a "
"Registered User publishes an LDM dataset in this form, she or he agrees to the sharing of metadata with DataCite. The sharing of such data is based on user "
"consent given as part of the service of DataCite e. V. and ORCiD. Registered Users need to connect their LDM profile with ORCiD and need to explicitly "
"activate DOI-based publication of the LDM datasets."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/special_conditions_LDM.html:77
msgid "Rights and obligations of the TIB"
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/special_conditions_LDM.html:78
msgid "LDM dataset metadata created by Registered Users is licensed to TIB under the licence CC0 1.0 Universal (CC0 1.0 Public Domain Dedication)."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/special_conditions_LDM.html:79
msgid ""
"The TIB assumes no liability that the service and its content are always uninterrupted, unchanged and available in full, as well as being up-to-date and free"
" from errors of an editorial or technical nature. No liability is accepted for damage caused by trusting the content of the platform or its use."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/special_conditions_LDM.html:80
msgid ""
"The TIB reserves the right to change the functionality, the appearance and these Special Conditions of the LDM at any time. Registered Users will be informed"
" of the changes two weeks in advance by email. By continuing to use the platform after the deadline, users agree to the changes."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/special_conditions_LDM.html:81
msgid ""
"The TIB is entitled to terminate its service at any time. In this case, the TIB reserves the right to delete the content. However, this does not result in an"
" obligation to delete the content."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/special_conditions_LDM.html:82
msgid ""
"The TIB provides scientific information in all areas of engineering as well as chemistry, information technology, mathematics and physics to the public. If "
"content by Registered Users does not satisfy the quality criteria TIB generally applies to scientific information, TIB may exclude the content from its "
"services without prior notice."
